SUMMARY:La La Land
DTSTAMP:20260723T054506Z
DTSTART:20260811T191500Z
DESCRIPTION:It's been a decade since La La Land first danced across the scr
	een and stole our hearts. To celebrate the 10th anniversary\, we're bringi
	ng Mia and Sebastian's technicolor world back to the rooftop. Whether you'
	re a jazz purist or just a hopeless romantic\, join us under the stars to 
	toast to the fools who dream!\n\nhttps://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/
	uptown/screenings/la-la-land-22884\n\nFrom Rooftop Cinema Club Houston
